<title>JAPAN: Japan Aug imported vehicle sales fall 2.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan Aug imported vehicle sales fall 2.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales of imported vehicles in Japan fell 2.9 percent in August to 26,542 from a year earlier, the Japan Automobile Importers Association (JAIA) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>					   (pct change over year earlier)</p>
<p>  Cars			     23,432	     -6.5</p>
<p>   - Over 2000 cc		15,954	    -11.3</p>
<p>   - Under 2000 cc		7,478	     +5.6</p>
<p>  Trucks			    3,109	    +37.4</p>
<p>   - Heavy			  2,281	     +6.5</p>
<p>   - Light			    828	   +584.3</p>
<p>  Buses				   1		 --</p>
<p>  Total			    26,542	     -2.9</p>
</text>
